<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114027" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῑλ-ός </span></b> ( <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειλός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Ael.Dion.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			323
		</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
			397
		</span></i>)), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ </span>(ἡ
		<i><span class="en">
			Babr.
			46.3
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>green fodder for
				cattle,</i> esp. for horses and beasts of burden, <i>forage,
				provender,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.140
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.9.27
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δὲ κτήνη πάντα χιλῷ ἔνδον
				ἐτρέφοντο</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.5.25
			</span></i>; of soldiers, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμβάνειν χιλόν</span>”
				<i>forage,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.3.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς χ. διατελέσαι</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὁδόν</span>) complete a stage
			for <i>forage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.5.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποις χ. ἐμβαλεῖν,
				παραβάλλεσθαι</span> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Eum.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.678a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξηρὸς χ.</span>”
				<i>hay,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.5.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later,
				<i>pasturage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Babr.
			</span></i> l.c.</div>
